# What KSP2 2.3.12 (KSPJvmMain) logs with Annotations.kt over java-array-defaults/Use.kt, with
# java-array-defaults/dependency/ on the classpath (built by javac): every array element a Java
# annotation declares without a default has an empty array as its default.
